;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;Custom dialogue settings, custom code
;※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※※
;made it as a way to speed up the update process and separate simple flag updates from various customization options
;note: options start from 1!
@KOJO_OPTION_K92
CALL KOJO_OPTION_ITEM("Change traits to match the dialogue better", 1, "cond", (ABL:92:12 < 3 || ABL:92:13 < 3 || TALENT:92:11 < 0 || TALENT:92:70 < 1))

;process the input portion
@KOJO_OPTION_K92_RESULT_1
PRINTFORML If set, Technique and Servitude will go to Lv3, [Docile] will be removed, and [Enjoys Pleasure] will be added.
PRINTFORML ([Docile] will come back later)
PRINTFORML
CALL ASK_YN
SELECTCASE RESULT
	;いいよ
	CASE 0
		CFLAG:92:1001 = 1
		PRINTFORML Traits will be changed.
		;変更内容はここに記述
		SIF ABL:92:12 < 3
			ABL:92:12 = 3
		SIF ABL:92:13 < 3
			ABL:92:13 = 3
		TALENT:92:11 = 0
		TALENT:92:70 = 1
		PRINTFORMW
;だめよ
CASEELSE
	CFLAG:92:1001 = -1
	PRINTFORML Traits will not be changed.
	PRINTFORMW
ENDSELECT

