@M_KOJO_ENCOUNTER_K92
;初対面、挨拶のタイミング
;TALENTの変更はここでどうぞ。
PRINTL  
;遭遇した回数を＋１する
TCVAR:350 += 1
PRINTFORMW 「How now, %PRINT_MALE("sirrah:madam", MASTER)%! Look at me, if thou please.」
PRINTFORMW 「Yes, I mean thee. Come closer, I wish to speak with thee.」
PRINTFORMW 「Hmmmm... I do not recognize thy face. Mayhap thou hast newly arrived in Gensokyo! Please, givest me thy name!」
PRINTFORMW 「I see, so thou art called %CALLNAME:MASTER%. Fear not, I am a friend to humans. Thou needn't be so wary of me.」
PRINTFORMW 「My name is Mononobe no Futo. I am a shikaisen in the service of Prince Shoutoku!」
PRINTFORMW 「My Taoist faith never turneth away any who come, I shall always welcome a new disciple!」
PRINTFORMDW Futo strikes a self-important pose and shakes her over-sized sleeves, so that the ribbons dangling from them flutter in the breeze.
PRINTFORML
PRINTFORML
CALL KOJO_OPTION_K92_RESULT_1 ;custom code
RETURN 1

