@M_KOJO_SPEVENT_K92_2(ARG,ARG:1)
;口上主はTARGET
;地の文表示
;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;小分岐
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白内容
	;この告白内容表示後に受けるかどうかの選択分が表示されます
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 0
		PRINTFORMW 「......」
		PRINTFORMDW At the conclusion of your date, you start to notice that Futo has been acting uncharacteristically shy compared to the usual.
		PRINTFORMDW She suddenly halts, with her back turned to you. Though you can't see her face, you notice her ears are flushed...
		PRINTFORMDL She definitely doesn't look like her normal exuberant self. Instead, it looks like she's struggling with some pretty serious pent-up emotions.
		PRINTFORMDW She's practically on the verge of exploding, her hands clenched into trembling, white-knuckled fists...
		PRINTFORMDW A heavy silence descends around you, but finally Futo musters up the courage to face you.
		PRINTFORML
		;She uses a very formal way to address the player- お主. Can be translated as "master", "husband"... translate as "my lord" or "milord"?
		PRINTFORMW 「It pains me so much... To do this while on our much-anticipated date. %PRINT_MALE("Milord:Milady", MASTER)% has ever been, so generous with thy time...」
		PRINTFORMW 「I do not wish... For thee to, witness me... Like this... Hic...」
		PRINTFORMDW Her dam is starting to break, the piled-up feelings starting to leak through as tears. A sob escapes her lips, but she soldiers on.
		PRINTFORML
		;I've gone back and forth on whether to translate 太子様 as Crown Prince or as Taishi-sama. Currently settling on Taishi-sama...
		PRINTFORMW 「As a servant of the Taishi-sama, I hath devoted the entirety of my life to her. One by one, I buried my own clansmen.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Even unto the taking of my own life, even unto my reanimation after the passing of a thousand years...」
		PRINTFORMW 「Nary a shadow of a doubt was in my mind that I would give my all for the Taishi-sama.」
		PRINTFORMW 「I believed with utter conviction that was my joy, and the reason for my very existence.」
		PRINTFORMDW She wipes away a large tear with her sleeve, but keeps going, her eyes remaining fixed on you.
		PRINTFORML
		PRINTFORMW 「These past days, I have had so much fun whiling away the time with thee, %PRINT_MALE("Milord:Milady", MASTER)%. Being by thy side maketh me... happy.」
		PRINTFORMW 「The Taishi-sama and Tojiko aside, nobody else hath ever made me feel this way.」
		PRINTFORMW 「The games we played, the memories we shared, the paths we walked together... They all brought me uncounted joy.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Though I am a quarrelsome and standoffish girl, thou ever remains by my side... Thou art the one who fills my spirit, %PRINT_MALE("Milord:Milady", MASTER)%.」
		PRINTFORMW 「%PRINT_MALE("Milord:Milady", MASTER)%... No, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. %CALLNAME:MASTER%, I love thee.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Please, I beg thee... Be my lover.」
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白オッケー（恋人が付く）
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 1
		PRINTFORML
		PRINTFORMW 「...Thank you. From the bottom of my heart. Then I shall entrust myself to thy care from now on, %CALLNAME:MASTER%.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Mmm-hmm! Now that the matter is settled, let us debate where next to go when we go a-courting, %CALLNAME:MASTER%!」
		PRINTFORMW 「My mind returns once more to that new coffee lounge, and their exquisite menu! Oh, how I wish we could go there without delay!」
		PRINTFORMDW Excitedly chattering away, Futo leaps at you and clings to your arm. She doesn't leave you a moment's rest for a good, long while...
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF
	;-------------------------------------------------
	;告白失敗
	;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
	LOCAL:1 = 1
	;-------------------------------------------------
	IF LOCAL:1 && ARG == 2
		PRINTFORML
		PRINTFORMW 「...So be it. I am sorry, please pretend I said nothing.」
		PRINTFORMW 「I did enjoy myself today, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. Please feel free to invite me again... If thou ever feels so inclined.」
		PRINTFORMDW With her eyes swollen an inflamed red, Futo dejectedly turns from you and trudges away...
		RETURN 1
	ENDIF

ENDIF
RETURN 1

